       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DIFFUSION-IR-SENSOR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DIFFUSION-IR-PROOFS.
           05  WS-IR-SPECTRAL-LATENT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ATMOSPHERIC-DENOISE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FLIR-STANAG-TELEMETRY-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CROSS-SPECTRAL-BIJECT-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-THERMAL-RADIOMETRIC-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DIFF-IR-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-DIFF-IR-PROVEN       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DIFF-IR-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-IR-LATENT-AND-DENOISING.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-STANAG-FLIR-FUSION.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-RADIOMETRIC-CONSISTENCY.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-DIFF-IR-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-IR-LATENT-AND-DENOISING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-IR-SPECTRAL-LATENT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ATMOSPHERIC-DENOISE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-STANAG-FLIR-FUSION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FLIR-STANAG-TELEMETRY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CROSS-SPECTRAL-BIJECT-OK.
       3000-EVALUATE-RADIOMETRIC-CONSISTENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-THERMAL-RADIOMETRIC-OK.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-DIFF-IR-PROOFS.
           IF WS-IR-SPECTRAL-LATENT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ATMOSPHERIC-DENOISE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FLIR-STANAG-TELEMETRY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CROSS-SPECTRAL-BIJECT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-THERMAL-RADIOMETRIC-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-DIFF-IR-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DIFF-IR-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-DIFF-IR-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DIFF-IR-CODE.
